      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "APPEARANCES:\nGARRY G. MATHIASON, ESQ., San Francisco, Cal.; on behalf of Petitioner.\nROBERT BONSALL, ESQ., Sacramento, Cal; on behalf of Respondent Teamsters Local 287.\nPETER D. NUSSBAUM, ESQ., San Francisco, Cal; on behalf of Respondent International Brotherhood of Teamsters."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0000-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "CHIEF JUSTICE ROBERTS: It's a tort action, right?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Granite Rock Company",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0000-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. MATHIASON: It is a tort action by being"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Granite Rock Company",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0000-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 7,
        "start": 7
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. MATHIASON: We take the position that the contract has within it the protection of the contract."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE GINSBURG: If the contract had read, not simply \"claims arising under this contract,\" but in addition said \"including the formation or breach thereof,\" if the -- if the arbitration clause had included formation, then you would have no argument."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0001-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 25,
        "start": 25
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The trial court recognized this fact, in joint appendix page 231."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Employer",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0001-0005",
      "kind": "allegation",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 32,
        "start": 32
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The employer is alleging that there is a breach of the no-strike clause."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Teamsters Local 287",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0001-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 33,
        "start": 33
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. BONSALL: We expect the arbitrator to take a look at the facts that existed on July 2nd and make a determination whether in fact at that point in time the union has a meritorious claim that the contract was not ratified, and therefore the no-strike clause --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d672f527afc7270a309d6560f3ce3cab9d1d7f7b4f6276b49da84cb779fdf1ff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d672f527afc7-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KENNEDY: Do you take the position that the cause of action for interference with a contract has been pre-empted insofar as State law is concerned?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2009-08-1214",
